abstract: "Reproducible AHP and TOPSIS calculations, expert-response dispersion for payment-delay risk, and exploratory two-rule ANFIS and non-adaptive FIS comparisons. R2 through R6 are reconstructed scenarios; no independent outcome validation is claimed."
